Kicking off this beautiful weekend morning with a long walk with the pups...before I get back to work..

Because in 9 short days, we'll be hosting 750 who are traveling from all over the world for 2 days of networking, learning and fun.

Sept 21-22 in Sunny San Diego CA for @CommerceRound!

Here's the plan:

- 2 Days of actionable content via educational keynotes by 18 amazing speakers who are in the trenches       

- A unique experience right on the water, the entire day , designed for networking and learning      

- The BEST (hands down, guaranteed) food that you can have as much as you want!      

- $220,000 of on stage giveways happening all day every day (F1 Trip, Hawaii vacations, Apple products, Pizza Ovens, Caraway, iRestore, Meta Glasses and much more)   

- A constant stream of snacks, coffee, tea and drinks

- A live DJ set by our very own DTC Founder DJ with open bar (alcoholic and alternative) + sunset vibes   

 - Plenty of afterparties hosted by our amazing sponsors (dinners, happy hours, experiences, etc) all 3 nights       

Plus you get to network and connect IRL with folks you've been talking on the internet with!

And what's the content about?

Tactical and practical keynote presentations on: DTC Growth, AI, Acquisition, Retention, Operations, Finance, and much more.

Led by the best MC: @iamshackelford 

